\begin_layout Standard
Take two convergent sequences 
\begin_inset Formula $x^{t}\underset{t\to\infty}{\longrightarrow}x$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $y^{t}\underset{t\to\infty}{\longrightarrow}y$
\end_inset

